OL,3,ATrump makes final campaign push in
OL,4,Afinal weekend before election
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolls suggest that Democrats have a
OL,7,Fgood chance at winning at least partial
OL,8,Fcontrol of Congress, which would act as
OL,9,Fa check on Trump's power and could
OL,10,Fupend the last two years of his
OL,11,Fpresidency.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
